  "description": "Boba Fett and Cad Bane. Once they'd been allies in the criminal underworld, but never quite saw eye to eye. Bane had taken Fett under his wing for a time, but it never seemed to work out to Boba's advantage, and the young clone of Jango realized that he was being taken advantage of more than mentored. As the two of them face off on the dusty streets of Mos Espa, they bring their bad blood to their showdown. Both are confident they'll come out on top, but only one of them will leave their duel alive."
